flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Load criteria and configuration]
    B --> C{Weights equal 100%?}
    C -- No --> X[Show error]
    C -- Yes --> D[Select supplier PDFs]
    D --> E{At least one selected?}
    E -- No --> Y[Request selection]
    E -- Yes --> F[Extract PDF text]
    F --> G[Retrieve evidence from ChromaDB]
    G --> H[Call OpenRouter]
    H --> I[Validate structured output]
    I --> J{Valid response?}
    J -- No --> K[Report error / bounded retry]
    J -- Yes --> L[Calculate weighted score]
    K --> M{More suppliers?}
    L --> M
    M -- Yes --> F
    M -- No --> N[Rank and persist results]
    N --> O[Render dashboard and export]
    X --> P([End])
    Y --> P
    O --> P
